Why wouldn't I be okay? I just asked if you could help me. What are you, a doctor or something? Geez.
Then what do you want?
I am wondering if you know how to get to the airport from here?
Yes, of course I do. You will continue going straight onto Main Street. At your fifth light, you will make a right onto Weaverly Road. I'd say about three-quarters of a mile up the road, you will see the entrance to the airport. You will start to see signs as well.
I love that author, are you enjoying the book?
Yes I am.
