I'm going to the store later.
Can you pick something up for dinner while you're out?
Sure, what would you like to have?
Let's have chicken parmesan. I'll cook if you pick up the ingredients.
OK, sounds great!
Would you be willing to go to Six Flags with me?
I'd like that. How about next weekend?
That doesn't suit me.
