I'm getting my free day on Wednesday this week.
I cannot go on Wednesday.
Can you look up directions, please?
Where do you want to go?
I would like to go to the new mall.
The one by the lake?
No, the one under the lake. Of course, the one by the lake!
I thought we were going looking for Atlantis.
What is the weather forecast for tomorrow?
Cloudy, with a 20% chance of rain.
Oh, now that's sucks!
Really? It's only a 20% chance and the weather people are almost always wrong.
I am actually wanting it to rain so I don't have to go out and water the garden myself.
Well, let's hope that 20% happens then!
How is the weather?
It's good, it's warm outside.
Should I carry an umbrella? Is it too hot or just mildly sunny?
It's getting quite hot out, actually.
Okay, looks like I will bring an umbrella and sunscreen then, thanks!
Don't mention it.
How do you use this?
Grab the trigger and squeeze.
I think that was the magazine release.
