When is the surgery scheduled?
It's scheduled next Wednesday.
So, you're going to drive me, right?
Of course! When should I pick you up?
Can you pick me up at noon? I have to be there by one to fill out paperwork.
Okay, no issues.
How is your break going?
It's fine and I have the possibility to relax.
Do you have any fun plans for your break?
Yes! I might try that new restaurant that just opened.
Cool! I just tried it yesterday and they have some pretty good dishes!
What would you recommend?
Do you eat pickles?
No, I hate them.
Why do you hate them? They are so tangy!
