I want to eat everything, I'm so hungry.
Can you be more specific?
How about Chinese food?
That sounds really yummy.
Yeah, but Chinese food fills you up and then you're hungry two hours later. How about Mexican?
I have my driver's license. Do you have yours?
Of course, it's in my wallet.
Ok, good. Hopefully they will let us in then.
