I hail from Jamaica.
Weird. I don't hear any accent.
I went to an American school.
Cool. Where in Jamaica?
I went to school in the capital.
Oh, I am so sorry to hear that, why not try to sleep now?
You're right. I need to get some rest.
Would you like to use our guest room until dinner is ready?
That would be amazing.
Go upstairs, first door on the right.
See you in a bit.
