12 next year.
He will be driving before you know it!
I know! Did you know he wants to start dating already?
That's pretty much what most boys at that age want to do.
Yeah, but I think it's too soon though.
How are you guys doing?
We are doing fine, thanks for asking.
You're welcome! You all should come visit sometime!
I'd love that! When are you free?
My schedule is pretty full, but maybe sometime this summer?
Sounds good - maybe a Fourth of July party?
