Is this your umbrella, miss?
Oh, yes, it is. Thank you. I was looking for it just now.
You look a bit familiar to me. I wonder if I have seen you somewhere before.
Have you?
May I ask where you live?
Just two blocks away, in that tall building.
That's it. I live there, too. I live on the sixth floor.
My family move in just two weeks ago. We live on the fourth floor.
