What section does it have?
Let me see. There's the news section, the entertainment section, sports, business, and world affairs.
What's in that section?
World affairs? They look at the most important stories in more detail. I find it fascinating. Do you buy a daily paper?
I buy a national newspaper sometimes, buy I nearly always buy a local evening newspaper. I find the local news more interesting than national or international news.
