good luck!
Do you watch a lot of TV?
Not really. I could take it or leave it.
Not me. I have to have my TV and watch whatever comes on.
How can you do that?
I am certain I am going to fail my English test.
Why are you so pessimistic?
Because it's impossible to improve listening level within a week.
Only for this reason?
