everything's great. I've just returned from my office.
your office? Aren't you a freelancer?
sure I am. I work for myself, but I've rented a virtual office at an office building in the downtown area.
a virtual office?
yeah, an office that runs efficiently by using nothing other than online communication technologies. I pay the rent and share office services with others in the same building.
what kind of services do they offer?
a separated office, internet access, phone services, fax services, mail & courier services, and almost everything you have in a conventional office.
